id: K8S-011
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: Kubernetes privileged container (trivial escape)
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: .git/ node_modules/
  content_contains: container
patterns:
  - regex: privileged:\s*true
    message: "Privileged container — has full host access, container escape is trivial"
  - regex: hostNetwork:\s*true
    message: "hostNetwork — container shares host network namespace, can sniff all traffic"
  - regex: hostPID:\s*true
    message: "hostPID — container can see and signal all host processes"
fix: Remove privileged: true. Use securityContext with specific capabilities instead of full privilege.
